(version 1)
# Spec 6.2 / global constraint "Sense tongue": no copper within 1.5 mm of the SHT45 except its
# own pads and traces. The rule area SHT45_ISOLATION (board file) covers the island, the slot
# and the neck; it bans vias and pours there. This rule bans every other part's pads there.
(rule "SHT45 isolation: only the SHT45's own pads"
  (constraint disallow pad)
  (condition "A.intersectsArea('SHT45_ISOLATION') && !A.memberOfFootprint('U1')"))
